          "title": "You'll want to know: पधारणो",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पधारणो — padhārṇo — \"to come (said with respect)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आप काल पधारो हो? āp kāl padhāro ho? Will you be coming tomorrow?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): वो घरै पधार्यो, vo gharai padhāryo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
